# questing-beast-makes-combat-damage-unpreventable-through-the-one-ring.) Bot2 casts The One Ring on turn 2, protection from everything
# until its next turn, and The Wondrous Wasp, which strips the Beast of every ability: on turn 3 all the Beast's damage is prevented.

